# Card Asset & Prompt Guidelines

When generating or editing card image assets for this project:

1. **Card Frame Constraint & Aspect Ratio (Edge-to-Edge):**
   - Use aspect ratio `2:3` (vertically taller portrait format) so the card never has to be cropped.
   - The card must fill 100% of the image frame.
   - Do NOT generate background elements (no tables, no hands, no playmats, no outer margins).

2. **Omit Bottom Clutter & Metadata:**
   - Omit the bottom-left 8-digit serial number / passcode.
   - Omit the card set / edition ID (e.g., `LOB-001` or `1st Edition`).
   - Omit the bottom-right copyright text row (e.g., `©1996 KAZUKI TAKAHASHI`).

3. **Standard Prompt Format:**
   `Yu-Gi-Oh classic trading card game [Monster/Spell/Trap] card [Card Name], full bleed direct front scan, card fills 100% of the image frame, no background, no table, no outer borders, no serial number, no set ID, no copyright text, vintage [monster yellow / spell green / trap pink] card frame, [description], level [X], ATK [X] DEF [X]`

4. **Destination & Registration:**
   - Save to `cards/<card_name>.png` (lowercase with underscores).
   - Register card data in `js/cards.js`.
